{'symbol': 'CHTR', 'date': '2022-03-07 11:00:00', 'title': 'CHARTER TO PARTICIPATE IN DEUTSCHE BANK MEDIA, INTERNET AND TELECOM CONFERENCE', 'text': 'STAMFORD, CONN., MARCH 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CHARTER COMMUNICATIONS, INC. (NASDAQ: CHTR) (ALONG WITH ITS SUBSIDIARIES, "CHARTER") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT JESSICA FISCHER, CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE\xa0DEUTSCHE BANK MEDIA, INTERNET AND TELECOM CONFERENCE IN PALM BEACH, FLORIDA ON MONDAY, MARCH 14, 2022.'}